out={loc:{'id':identity('english7_u02_outcome_'+loc.lower()),'topic_id':topic,'official_code':None,'statement_hy':hy,'statement_en':en,'source_reference':'N 116-Ն · Grade 7 · Topic 2 · '+('Knowledge 'if loc[0]=='K'else 'Language abilities ')+loc[1:],'sequence_order':n,'status':'review','source_document_id':pid,'source_locator':'Grade7.Topic2.'+loc,'requirement_level':'mandatory','source_transcription_notes':'Exact Armenian bullet and punctuation; K/L are local locators, not official codes. English is explanatory. Knowledge/language bullets share should know/should be able to stems. L5 footnote: * Քննարկել – բանավոր և գրավոր փոխազդեցություն.'}for n,(loc,hy,en,route,refs,note) in enumerate(definitions,1)}
